Package: pairComparison
Type: Package
Title: A package for pair comparison methods
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Elaine Cecília Gatto
Maintainer: Prof. Elaine Cecilia Gatto <elainececiliagattto@gmail.com>
Description: Package for performing comparisons between pairs of methods. 
    For each evaluation metric, it analyzes in how many datasets one method 
    was better than the other.
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.0)
Imports:
    ggplot2,
    tibble,
    tidyr,
    dplyr,
    magrittr
